      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tëë kɛ gua̱a̱th kɛ ti diaal",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛŋu mi ci ram mi lät jɛ ɛ jek rɛy la̱tdɛ mɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän cä riɛk in ci Kuoth ɛ ka̱m naath nɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cɛ ti diaal lät kä gua̱thkiɛn tin luɔtkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ kɛ. Kä cɛ raan moc kɛ ca̱r, kä ŋotdɛ /cɛ min ci Kuothɛ la̱t ni tukä amäni guut ŋäc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋa̱cä jɛ thilɛ mi gɔaa kä naath, ɛ ni ɣöö bi lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth kä ba gɔy la̱t min ŋot kɛ kɛ tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn nɔmɔ bä ɛ muc Kuɔth ɛn ɣöö bi raan tekɛ mi camɛ kä bɛ maath kä bi lɔcdɛ tɛɛth rɛy lätnikɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋa̱cä jɛ ɛn ɣöö mi ci Kuoth ɛ la̱t, bɛ te thi̱n amäni cäŋ kɛl. Thilɛ mi ba mat thi̱n, kä thilɛ mi ba woc thi̱n. Lät Kuoth nɔmɔ kɛ ɣöö ba jɛ luɔ̱th ɛ naath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi te thi̱n ni wal. Kiɛ mɔ bi tuɔɔkɔ, ɛ jɛn mëë te thi̱n ni wal. Kä Kuoth lätdɛ ni mëë ci kɔŋ te wa̱nɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luk kɛnɛ min te nhiam kɛ nyin Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ mi dɔ̱ŋ lɛ nɛn bä rɛy ɣɔaa, cua̱ ji̱ dueeri nɛn guäth luɔ̱k, kä cua̱ kɛ nɛn bä guäth cuŋni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ ruac kɛ lɔcdä, bi Kuoth gua̱n cuŋni kɛnɛ gua̱n dueeri luk kɛɛl, kɛ ɣöö cɛ gua̱a̱th rialikä kɛ ciɛŋ diaal, kɛ gua̱a̱th kɛ lät diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ lɛ ruac kɛ lɔcdä bä i̱ kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱ ɣɔ̱n Kuoth nikɛ, kɛnɛ ɣöö bɛ nyuɔ̱th kɛ i̱ ce̱tkɛ nikɛ ley. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö riɛk nath ce̱tdɛ kɛ riɛk leeyni. Bi raan li̱w ce̱tnikɛ lia̱a̱ lɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈. Kɛ ɣöö te kɛn diaal kɛ yiëë ɔ kɛlɔ, thilɛ mi gɔaa kä raan mi lenyɛ ni ley. Kɛn diaal thilɛ kɛ luɔt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn diaal wä kɛ niɛ guäth ɔ kɛl ɔ. Kɛn diaal kɛ tur, kä bikɛ loc tuur kɛn diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö thilɛ ram mi ŋäc jɛ ɛn ɣöö bi yiëë ran wä nhial kä bi yiëë lɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ wä muun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ jɛ nɛn thilɛ mi gɔaa kɛ raan ɛ ni ɣöö bɛ la̱t ni la̱tdɛ kɛ ɣöö thilɛ mi dɔ̱ŋ mi derɛ la̱t. Kɛ ɣöö thilɛ ram mi dee jɛ nöŋ min ci lɔ̱ɔ̱ tuɔɔk kɔɔrɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
